osd-desk-snake (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Presets in the settings app: save every setting under a name, apply it in
    one click, import and export .osdsnake files, kept in
    ~/.config/osdsnake/presets. A set of presets comes with the app.
  * The highlight of the label, icon and window styles slides from desktop to
    desktop; fading along with the switch is still available.
  * Size setting that scales the whole indicator.
  * The background is transparent by default.
  * Dot on desktops with windows: size, distance and opacity; pills get a ring
    (thickness, gap) or a dot. Line highlight distance.
  * Fixes: clipped labels, dots and lines; circle cells of different sizes;
    the indicator rising into place when it opens; blank color picker with Qt
    6.10.2; touchpad scrolling direction in the settings app.

 -- rcspam <10021906+rcspam@users.noreply.github.com>  Sun, 27 Sep 2026 22:00:00 +0200

